Z||000000||KRMFiero||06-22-2001||11:08 PM||||I just ordered a Overhaul kit for my TH 440T4 Trans, does anyone know how to rebuild a automatic transmition? what is involved in it?   should I just send it somewhere?(if so where) any sites or any information anyone can provide would be useful\<P>thanks<BR>Kyle<P>------------------<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2M4 SE (Red) Caddy 4.5 Project<BR>1985 Pontiac Fiero 2M4 SE (White)<P>      <IMG SRC="http://members.aol.com/~Physcokyle/sig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||PBJ||06-22-2001||11:23 PM||||leave trans rebuilding for the experts,  stick or auto.  You need experience x 10, skill, and clean work space.||||reg||1
